-- A call script for examples/table.lang (S9, PLAN 4.9). test/evm.sh runs the
-- calls as t8n steps at NUMBER BLOCK, thus the caller is the t8n key address.
-- record: each rule on both sides of each threshold, then market 2 (not a
-- market, a revert). bet: an outcome in and out of range for each market,
-- each deadline (1000u, 2000u) one block before and at the deadline, market 2.
1 1u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b record 0u 60u 20u
2 2u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b record 0u 10u 20u
3 3u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b record 1u 5u 0u
4 4u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b record 1u 20u 0u
5 5u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b record 1u 30u 0u
6 6u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b record 2u 60u 20u
7 7u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 0u 1u
8 8u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 0u 2u
9 9u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 1u 2u
10 10u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 1u 3u
999 999u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 0u 0u
1000 1000u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 0u 0u
1999 1999u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 1u 0u
2000 2000u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 1u 0u
2001 2001u 0xa94f5374fce5edbc8e2a8697c15331677e6ebf0b bet 2u 0u
